{'symbol': 'CNP', 'date': '2022-08-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'CENTERPOINT ENERGY REPORTS STRONG SECOND QUARTER RESULTS AND RAISES FULL YEAR EARNINGS GUIDANCE', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CENTERPOINT ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: CNP) OR “CENTERPOINT” TODAY REPORTED INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $179 MILLION, OR $0.28 PER DILUTED SHARE ON A GAAP BASIS, FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022 COMPARED TO $0.37 OF DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE, INCLUDING $0.09 OF MIDSTREAM FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021. ON A NON-GAAP BASIS, EPS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER WAS $0.31, AN 11% INCREASE TO THE COMPARABLE QUARTER IN 2021. THE POSITIVE VARIANCE WAS PRIMARILY DRIVEN BY FAVORA'}